  "schema:description": "Graphite (aqueous processed). Electrode design of the IntelLiGent project batch (SINTEF), published under the label Gr-AQ-1. Active-material type as stated in metadata.csv: \"Graphite\".",
  "schema:citation": {
    "@id": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20086298",
    "@type": "schema:CreativeWork",
    "bibo:doi": "10.5281/zenodo.20086298"
  },
  "schema:comment": [
    "Design values are as published in metadata.csv for batch Gr-AQ-1, the one batch that realizes this design. The as-built figures of each individual disc are on the 7 electrode records that cite this spec.",
    "Active-mass loading: mean 3.8282 mg/cm2, sample standard deviation 0.1345 mg/cm2 over n = 7 discs (range 3.5818-3.9776 mg/cm2). Computed from the per-cell values metadata.csv publishes for this batch and carried on the quantity itself, not in this note.",
    "Dry thickness: 64.0 um for every one of the 7 discs. metadata.csv states this one value per cell, so the standard deviation is 0 by construction - a repeated declaration, not a measured spread.",
    "Nominal areal capacity: mean 1.4241 mAh/cm2, sample standard deviation 0.05 mAh/cm2 over n = 7 discs (range 1.3324-1.4797 mAh/cm2). Computed from the per-cell values metadata.csv publishes for this batch and carried on the quantity itself, not in this note."
  ],
